# Requirements of the `reboot[anthropic]` extra: the Anthropic SDK at
# the version that works with the `pydantic-ai-slim` release that
# `reboot` pins. Pydantic AI 1.x hands the SDK an `httpx` client;
# Anthropic SDK releases from 1.0 on are built on `httpx2` and reject
# it, so the extra keeps an application's resolve on the working line.
# Every line must also be in `requirements.in`, which stays the
# complete list that the Bazel lock compiles; the wheel build strips
# these from the package's dependencies and ships them as the extra.
anthropic==0.125.0 # The last release built on `httpx`.
